{
  "description": [
    "ctadl query model for the TaintBench `chulia` app. Sources and sinks are derived from",
    "the framework methods named in the source/sink IR (Jimple) signatures of",
    "chulia_findings.json: ContentResolver.query() returns the contact/SMS cursor and",
    "Location.getLongitude() the device position (sources); DefaultHttpClient.execute()",
    "posts them to the C2 server (sink). The sink uses Argument(*) so any tainted argument",
    "-- here the request built from the leaked data -- counts as a leak.",
    "The `propagation` models summarize the apache-http request plumbing the leaked data",
    "travels through -- BasicNameValuePair, UrlEncodedFormEntity/StringEntity,",
    "HttpPost.<init> and HttpPost.setEntity all forward their argument into the object they",
    "build. None of those classes has a body in the APK, so without a summary the taint stops",
    "before it reaches `execute`. `ctadl index` consumes these (they become function",
    "summaries) and `ctadl query` the sources and sinks; xtask passes this file to both.",
    "Every flow in this app also crosses a component boundary: the collected data is put in",
    "a Bundle, broadcast with sendBroadcast(), and read back out of the Intent extras in a",
    "BroadcastReceiver. ctadl does not model that inter-component hop, so no flow connects.",
    "ctadl ignores the non-schema `description` key, as it does `expected_lines` in the",
    "nightly models."
  ],
  "model_generators": [
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "query",
          "parent": "Landroid/content/ContentResolver;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "DatabaseData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "getLongitude",
          "parent": "Landroid/location/Location;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sources": [
          {
            "kind": "LocationData",
            "port": "Return"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "execute",
          "parent": "Lorg/apache/http/impl/client/DefaultHttpClient;"
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "sinks": [
          {
            "kind": "Exfiltration",
            "port": "Argument(*)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/message/BasicNameValuePair;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          },
          {
            "input": "Argument(2)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "<init>",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/entity/UrlEncodedFormEntity;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/entity/StringEntity;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpPost;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpGet;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "find": "methods",
      "where": [
        {
          "constraint": "signature_match",
          "name": "setEntity",
          "parents": [
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpPost;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/client/methods/HttpEntityEnclosingRequestBase;",
            "Lorg/apache/http/HttpEntityEnclosingRequest;"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "model": {
        "propagation": [
          {
            "input": "Argument(1)",
            "output": "Argument(0)"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
